Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp-oauth): drop signing algs from metadata, rename
 write-budget test files

#132: the authorization-server metadata wrapper that removes private_key_jwt
also removes token_endpoint_auth_signing_alg_values_supported, which only
applies to client assertions this gateway refuses. none and
client_id_metadata_document_supported stay.

#129: test-registration-counter.ts is now test-anonymous-write-budget.ts and
mcp-oauth-registration-counter.test.ts is mcp-oauth-anonymous-write-budget.test.ts,
matching what the budget counts.

